# A LANDSCAPE MOVES A MACHINE'S WORKING PART (mechanics 3a, part sides;
# MachineModel._move_part, BiomeDef.roster `over` part). The same hauler, turned
# the same way, in the bonelands with its knuckle drive on its left and in the
# limestone caves with it on its back (tours/part_sides_cave.tour, which boots
# under the world): the lit lens is where the blow must go.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/part_sides.tour --seed=7 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
place bonelands
coast calm
zoom 7
wait 0.6
spawn hauler@135
wait 0.8
shot 01-the-bonelands-hauler-works-with-its-left with mob:hauler,land:bonelands

